# ── Internal documents ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Commercial material, kept on disk and out of a now-public repo:
#
#   PRICING-WORKSHEET  how to price a shop — the method, and eventually the
#                      numbers. Nobody buying an install needs to read it.
#   DEMO-POST          unpublished marketing drafts
#
# SHIPPING-PLAN.md and REPORT.md are deliberately NOT here. Both are
# templates with no real figures in them, and the shipping plan — an honest
# log of what broke and what is still unproven — is worth more read than
# hidden.
#
# NOTE: everything here was tracked until 13 Aug 2026 and remains in git
# history. Ignoring a file stops it appearing in the checkout; it does not
# unpublish it. Anything genuinely secret should be treated as disclosed and
# rotated, not hidden behind this list.
docs/PRICING-WORKSHEET.md
docs/DEMO-POST.md

# The written proposal carries a second personal email address, and a public
# repo is a spam-scraper's feedstock. prompts.md is a scratch list of
# one-line feature notes to self — no use to a reader, and not the record
# anyone should judge the work by. Both stay local.
/proposal/
/prompts.md